```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending : 開單
  pending --> in_progress : 接單 / 指派
  pending --> cancelled : 取消
  in_progress --> completed : 完工回報
  in_progress --> pending : 退回待處理
  in_progress --> cancelled : 取消
  completed --> closed : 確認驗收
  completed --> closed : 7 天自動關單（pg_cron）
  completed --> in_progress : 重開單
  closed --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]

  note right of completed : 完工後逾期 7 天未回覆，<br/>由 pg_cron 每日 03:00 UTC 自動結單
```

對照實作：`src/server/tickets/lifecycle.ts` 的七種 transition
（claim / assign / submit_closure / confirm_fix / reopen / return_to_pending / cancel）。
